    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558000/extras/b6057347a28bf77d96d4d6aa949fae01.avif?t=1748278208\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SAY [HELLO] TO THE [NEW YOU]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An exploration of reality, technology, and our place between them - [ECHOSTASIS] is an award-winning science-fiction horror first-person shooter with puzzle elements which acts as the climactic conclusion to the <i>THE ENIGMA TRILOGY</i>, offering an ever-evolving [STORY] possible through the medium of games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[WHO ARE YOU]?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558000/extras/dd768b37569493e3cd87b4db02aa3a30.poster.avif?t=1748278208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558000/extras/dd768b37569493e3cd87b4db02aa3a30.webm?t=1748278208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558000/extras/dd768b37569493e3cd87b4db02aa3a30.mp4?t=1748278208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>In <i><strong>[ECHOSTASIS]</strong></i> You <strong>Play The [ROLE]</strong> of the [ADMINISTRATOR] inside [ENIGMA]'s [HEADQUARTERS], just as a [VIRUS] has been uploaded to [HER] - an [ALGORITHM] that creates personalized realities known as [ECHOES]. It is your [JOB] is to delve into the minds of three key [SUBJECTS] who have become lost in the [CLOUD]. Use the [TERMINAL] to gather your [THOUGHTS] about [WHAT HAPPENED], by typing in any words you see in brackets [LIKE THIS].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[[DREAMSCAPE] EXPLORER]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558000/extras/db03469d69e1120f336d32e61d472d06.poster.avif?t=1748278208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558000/extras/db03469d69e1120f336d32e61d472d06.webm?t=1748278208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558000/extras/db03469d69e1120f336d32e61d472d06.mp4?t=1748278208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Your [JOB] is to delve into the minds of each lost [SUBJECT] and figure out [WHAT HAPPENED] to them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you can only spend limited time in the [DREAMSCAPE], you must use your time wisely to open shortcuts to new [PATHS] and weapons that will let you delve deeper into these lost [SUBJECTS] minds. Only once you face the horrors that await in each [SUBJECTS] [DREAMSCAPE] can you [HELP] bring them [HOME].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud835\udd4b\u210d\ud835\udd40\u2115\ud835\udd3e\ud835\udd4a \ud835\udd3b\ud835\udd46\u2115'\ud835\udd4b \ud835\udd44\ud835\udd38\ud835\udd42\ud835\udd3c \ud835\udd4a\ud835\udd3c\u2115\ud835\udd4a\ud835\udd3c \ud835\udd38\u2115\ud835\udd50\ud835\udd44\ud835\udd46\u211d\ud835\udd3c,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud835\udd39\ud835\udd4c\ud835\udd4b \ud835\udd4e\ud835\udd3c'\u211d\ud835\udd3c \ud835\udd3e\ud835\udd46\ud835\udd40\u2115\ud835\udd3e \ud835\udd4b\ud835\udd46 \ud835\udd44\ud835\udd38\ud835\udd42\ud835\udd3c \ud835\udd4b\u210d\ud835\udd40\ud835\udd4a \u211d\ud835\udd40\ud835\udd3e\u210d\ud835\udd4b.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A seamless blend of puzzles, exploration and combat set within an entirely unique presentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Navigate the minds of your [SUBJECTS] as they slip further into [ECHOSTASIS]. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain a better understanding of [WHAT HAPPENED] around the events of <i>THE ENIGMA MACHINE</i> (2018) and <i>MOTHERED - A ROLE-PLAYING HORROR GAME</i> (2021)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace the [NEW YOU] with an open-ended keyword system via the fully interactive [TERMINAL].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <i>Lose Your[SELF]</i> within a mind bending conclusion to a [STORY] that will keep you guessing until the very [END].<br>    \u23b5</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558000/extras/05d1aa320eacdccd5b02e3b7cd358795.poster.avif?t=1748278208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558000/extras/05d1aa320eacdccd5b02e3b7cd358795.webm?t=1748278208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558000/extras/05d1aa320eacdccd5b02e3b7cd358795.mp4?t=1748278208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
